---
export const prerender = false;
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Terms of Service — fanfiction.fyi">
  <article class="legal-page">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: April 2026</p>

    <section>
      <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By accessing or using fanfiction.fyi, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, do not use the site.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
      <p>fanfiction.fyi is a small-scale, invite-only fanfiction archive. We provide tools for creating, sharing, and discussing fan-authored works of fiction. The service is provided "as is" and may be modified or discontinued at any time.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Account Registration</h2>
      <p>You must have an invitation code to create an account. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials and for all activity under your account. You must be at least 13 years old to use this service.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. User Content</h2>
      <h3>Ownership</h3>
      <p>You retain all rights to content you create and publish on fanfiction.fyi. By posting content, you grant us a limited, non-exclusive license to display, distribute, and store that content on the service for as long as it remains published.</p>

      <h3>Responsibility</h3>
      <p>You are solely responsible for the content you post. You represent that you have the right to publish any content you upload, including any copyrighted material used under fair use or with permission.</p>

      <h3>Removal</h3>
      <p>You may delete your own content at any time. We reserve the right to remove content that violates these terms, applicable law, or community standards.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Post content that is illegal, harassing, hateful, or threatens harm</li>
        <li>Upload malware, spam, or automated scraping scripts</li>
        <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to other users' accounts or to our systems</li>
        <li>Use the service to distribute unlicensed copyrighted material outside fair use</li>
        <li>Impersonate other users or misrepresent your identity</li>
        <li>Deliberately disrupt or overload the service's infrastructure</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. Moderation</h2>
      <p>We may, at our discretion, moderate content and user behavior. This includes editing titles or tags for clarity, hiding content that violates these terms, suspending or banning accounts, and merging duplicate tags. Moderation decisions are final and not subject to appeal.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <h3>Your Content</h3>
      <p>You own your original works. Fanfiction inherently draws from existing intellectual property; you are responsible for ensuring your use falls within fair use or other applicable exceptions.</p>

      <h3>Our Platform</h3>
      <p>The fanfiction.fyi platform, including its design, code, and branding, is our intellectual property. You may not copy, modify, or redistribute the platform itself.</p>

      <h3>DMCA &amp; Takedown</h3>
      <p>If you believe your copyrighted work is being used unlawfully, contact us at <a href="mailto:admin@fanfiction.fyi">admin@fanfiction.fyi</a> with a description of the material and your ownership claim. We will respond to valid takedown requests promptly.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>8. Privacy</h2>
      <p>Our handling of personal data is described in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, which is incorporated into these terms by reference.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>9. Disclaimers</h2>
      <p>The service is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied. We do not guarantee uninterrupted access, data preservation, or error-free operation. We are not responsible for the content posted by users.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, fanfiction.fyi and its operators shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the service. Our total liability shall not exceed the amount you have paid to use the service (which is zero for free accounts).</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>11. Termination</h2>
      <p>You may stop using the service at any time. We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms. Upon termination, your right to access the service ceases immediately. Provisions on ownership, disclaimers, and liability survive termination.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>12. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms from time to time. We will note the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance. Material changes may be communicated via site notice or email.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>13. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the United States. Any disputes shall be resolved in the jurisdiction where the service is operated.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>14. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms? Reach us at <a href="mailto:admin@fanfiction.fyi">admin@fanfiction.fyi</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </article>

  <style>
    .legal-page {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4);
    }

    .legal-page h1 {
      font: var(--md-sys-typescale-headline-large);
      color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    }

    .legal-updated {
      font: var(--md-sys-typescale-body-small);
      color: var(--md-sys-color-outline);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    }

    .legal-page h2 {
      font: var(--md-sys-typescale-title-medium);
      color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface);
      margin-top: var(--space-6);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    }

    .legal-page h3 {
      font: var(--md-sys-typescale-title-small);
      color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
      margin-top: var(--space-3);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    }

    .legal-page p {
      font: var(--md-sys-typescale-body-large);
      color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    }

    .legal-page ul {
      font: var(--md-sys-typescale-body-large);
      color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
      line-height: 1.7;
      padding-left: var(--space-6);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    }

    .legal-page li {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    }

    .legal-page code {
      background: var(--md-sys-color-surface-container-highest);
      padding: 2px var(--space-2);
      border-radius: var(--md-sys-shape-corner-extra-small);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }

    .legal-page a {
      color: var(--md-sys-color-primary);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .legal-page a:hover {
      color: var(--md-sys-color-on-primary-container);
    }

    .legal-page section {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    }
  </style>
</Base>